⍝ ---- bytes and code points
ᛒ s i: byte i of s (from 0) as ℤ, or −1 past either end ⍝
⦃ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗̱⁰ ⧗¹ ⧗̱⁰ ⍴̱ △ ≫ ⊟ ⌖̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⚇ ⦄ ⦃ ▽ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ᛒ ⸫

⍝ ᚳ a i: element i (from 0) of an array whose element 0 is a sentinel; −1 past the end
⸫ ᚳ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⟗ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ▽ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⁇ ⌖̱ ⊟ ≫ △ ⍴̱ ⧗̱⁰ ⊞ △ ⧗¹ ⧗̱⁰ ⧖ ⧖ ⦄

ᚴ a: number of elements after the sentinel ⍝
⦃ ⍴̱ △ ⊟ ⦄ ⟨ ⟗ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ᚴ ⸫

⍝ ᛝ s i b0: the code point of a multi-byte UTF-8 sequence led by b0, and its length
